// Panel close: the open sound run backwards, zipping down two octaves.
// Composed in MML for the TerraForma example game; rendered with chipsynth (python -m chipsynth sfx).
title Panel close
author Claude, at Michael Allen Wilmes's request
tempo 240
once

[instr]
zip wave=pulse pw=25 a=0 d=6 s=8 r=4 vol=12 pws=60,20,8

V1: @zip o6 c32 slide 24 4c8
